  aciklama: "5. kat, daire 2, Karaca ailesinin evi; Cemal'in yar\u0131m b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131
    i\u015F (mekanizma). Kilerdeki kol mutfa\u011F\u0131 a\xE7ar; salonun anahtar\u0131
    k\u0131r\u0131k: ba\u015F\u0131 mutfak \xE7ekmecesinde, ucu Oda B'de masada.
    Gard\u0131rop levye (Oda A) ve kayd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131yla (hol) itilir, arkas\u0131nda
    vana; su kesilince sifon s\xF6k\xFCl\xFCr, a\u011Fz\u0131nda kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131.
    Banyo mente\u015Feli. Oda oda d\xF6\u015Fendi (#83)."
